QtMultimedia 6.12 on Haiku: an audio output backend on BSoundPlayer (the
system mixer), new files in src/multimedia/haiku/, and the FFmpeg media
plugin enabled on Haiku. HaikuPorts' 6.10.3 patch reused the WebAssembly
OpenAL backend, which 6.12 replaced with WebAudio; only its FFmpeg and
no-backend-warning conditions are carried over.

